            "review_text": "4familyadventure\nNairobi, Kenya357 contributions\n0\nVery healthy & delicious!\nNov 2019\nVery healthy & delicious! I will be back for sure! I ordered tuna, it was raw, I was expecting canned tuna. But it was yummy all the same. My husband ordered the teriyaki chicken and his was delicious too. Mango smoothies were excellent. Staff is helpful, friendly and fast. Very clean & bright restaurant with a nice upstairs area with Wi-Fi. Open 7am-9pm. Vegan & non vegan options. Vegan cupcakes. (I have not tried them yet, but they look moist and fresh).\nRead more\nWritten November 17, 2019\nSong Linh Food & Drink\nThank u for your compliment. I hope u come back soon ❤️\nWritten December 14, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
